msgid "Per-device traffic"
msgstr "设备流量"

msgid "Last sample:"
msgstr "最近采样："

msgid "Traffic data unavailable. Start nlbwmon after configuring its monitored networks. Displayed totals are from the last successful sample."
msgstr "无法读取流量数据。请配置监测网段后启动 nlbwmon。当前累计值来自上一次成功采样。"

msgid "No matching traffic data."
msgstr "没有匹配的流量数据。"

msgid "Hostname, MAC or IP address"
msgstr "主机名、MAC 或 IP 地址"

msgid "Filter devices"
msgstr "筛选设备"

msgid "Sort by"
msgstr "排序方式"

msgid "Total traffic"
msgstr "总流量"

msgid "Download traffic"
msgstr "下载流量"

msgid "Upload traffic"
msgstr "上传流量"

msgid "Sampled rate"
msgstr "采样速率"

msgid "Device"
msgstr "设备"

msgid "MAC address"
msgstr "MAC 地址"

msgid "IPv4 / IPv6 addresses"
msgstr "IPv4 / IPv6 地址"

msgid "Downloaded"
msgstr "已下载"

msgid "Uploaded"
msgstr "已上传"

msgid "Download rate"
msgstr "下载速率"

msgid "Upload rate"
msgstr "上传速率"

msgid "Totals cover the active nlbwmon accounting period. Rates use differences between samples; counter refresh follows the daemon interval, so these are sampled averages. The first sample, failed reads and decreasing counters have no rate."
msgstr "累计值覆盖 nlbwmon 当前统计周期。速率由两次采样的差值计算；计数更新取决于守护进程的刷新间隔，因此显示的是采样平均值。首次采样、读取失败和计数下降时不显示速率。"

msgid "Accounting settings"
msgstr "流量统计设置"

msgid "Database backup"
msgstr "数据库备份"
